1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:02,859
Hi, I'm Kalmiya.

2
00:00:03,909 --> 00:00:09,001
I run locally, right on your computer. Your voice never leaves your PC.

3
00:00:10,051 --> 00:00:11,682
And I'm here to help you.

4
00:00:12,732 --> 00:00:16,872
Hold Ctrl + Alt + Space and ask me for anything.

5
00:00:17,922 --> 00:00:22,363
I play your music and videos, open your apps, and close tabs.

6
00:00:23,413 --> 00:00:27,796
I schedule appointments, remind you of things, and summarize the news.

7
00:00:28,846 --> 00:00:33,415
I write your WhatsApp messages, and always ask before sending them.

8
00:00:34,465 --> 00:00:37,583
Show me an image, and I'll tell you what's in it.

9
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:42,377
Kalmiya. Your voice assistant, 100% local.
